# WereWamp™ — Stealth Character Class

## Overview

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Class Type | Stealth |
| Guild | Ownership Guild |
| Slaughter™ Improvement | 9 standard turns |
| Ownership | PlayersSpeak™ (not Actual™) |
| Known WereWamp™ | Olivia Tiedemann (Terrible of Man) |

## Mechanics

WereWamp™ abbreviates the Kill listing time requirement for Slaughtering UnDead™ players
who refuse to Guild until timeout or full Non-Ally™ status.

### PlayersSpeak™

Ownership does not require Actual™ (gram of Real™ is real). The player's mind as-is,
before and during Spell Conjure™, establishes ownership. No check-out required
(nor check-in, check-in).

### Divine Conclusion Privilege

Player may Conclude talking-terms about Divine before Conclusion on time itself.

## Target Conditions

- UnDead™ timed-out
- Total Non-Ally™ to time

## Known WereWamp™

- **Olivia Tiedemann** — Terrible of Man
